including the Framesaver ideas by Ari that it contains, was published without a license.
Its design and feature set, the clutter name lists (the keyword lists in src/ClutterRules.cs)
and anything else taken over from that mod remain the property of their original authors.
No rights to that material are granted here. If the original authors ask, it will be removed.

PART B - New material by R_F (MIT license)

